OL,3,GNEWSA'Where have you been?': Karl
OL,4,ABushby reunites with tearful mum in
OL,5,AHull after 28-year global trek
OL,6,
OL,7,FKarl Bushby has returned to his
OL,8,Fchildhood home in Hull after leaving
OL,9,FChile in November 1998 with the aim of
OL,10,Fwalking an unbroken path back to his
OL,11,Froots
OL,13,FTo date, he has crossed four
OL,14,Fcontinents, swum the English Channel
OL,15,Fand walked more than 31,000 miles
OL,16,F(58,000km)
OL,18,FFamily, friends and supporters have
OL,19,Fbeen waiting for him at the finish line
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
