OL,3,GNEWSA'Where have you been?': Karl
OL,4,ABushby reunites with tearful mum in
OL,5,AHull after 28-year global trek
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe crossed the Humber Bridge on Sunday
OL,8,Fand was 'overwhelmed' with the
OL,9,Freception
OL,11,FThe expedition has been mainly
OL,12,Fself-funded. However, sponsors have
OL,13,Fjoined along the way, including a
OL,14,FUS-based documentary firm
OL,16,FKarl has been sent a letter of
OL,17,Fcongratulations from Prime Minister
OL,18,FAndy Burnham, who has praised his
OL,19,Fdetermination and self belief
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
